    order: 18,
    content: "She brought him to her people carrying him. They accused her; she pointed to him. And he spoke - the whole of what he said from the cradle is given here - and then the Quran says who he is, and what is not befitting for Allah.",
    contentFr: "Elle le porta à son peuple. Ils l'accusèrent ; elle le désigna. Et il parla - tout ce qu'il dit depuis le berceau est donné ici - puis le Coran dit qui il est, et ce qui ne convient pas à Allah.",
